Package: mtgcodex.api
Type: Package
Title: MTG Codex Toolkit
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Florian", "Ricquier", email = "florian.ricquier@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: API and web interface for loading MTG collections from SQLite,
    CSV, or text files and analyzing explainable functional relationships
    between cards. The package exposes a Plumber service, a browser UI, and an
    rule-aware engine for directed synergies and small groups, including a
    structured Oracle-text representation with measurable parser coverage.
